<title>USA: South St. Paul, Minn., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>South St. Paul, Minn., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $5.155 million of South St. Paul, Minn., general obligation tax increment refunding bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.00 percent.</p>
</text>
